<line>Proportion 1 = <inu>prop_1</inu></line>
<line>Total 2 = <in>n_2</in>,  response 2 = <in>r_2</in></line>
<line>Proportion 2 = <inu>prop_2</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line>Proportion difference = <inu>prop_diff</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line><ci>Approximate (Miettinen) <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci></line>
